+### Requirement: Import tasks from text
+`importTasks(list, text)` SHALL read `text` one line per task, in the form `title;priority;tags`, add every valid line to `list` and return `{ imported, rejected }`. `imported` SHALL be the number of tasks added. Lines SHALL be split on `\n` or `\r\n`. The title SHALL be trimmed. The priority SHALL be trimmed; if empty or absent, the task is `normal`. Tags SHALL be separated by spaces (any run of whitespace), and the tags part MAY be empty or absent. Lines that are empty or only whitespace SHALL be skipped and are neither imported nor rejected.
